Description: Virtual machines for FreedomNAS
 FreedomNAS community module that sets up the edition's hypervisor on a data
 pool: libvirt with QEMU/KVM on Linux, vm-bhyve on FreeBSD.
 .
 Ships modules/vm/ and profiles/vm/ under /usr/lib/freedomnas/.
